  "description": "CYCLOCROSS\nNew for 2022, we've made some updates to the trusty Squidcross to make things a bit more modern. These include a new flatmount dropout, and updated chainstay yoke to accommodate those 650b gravel tire you all keep asking us about.\nThe Squidcross will take you where you're going; whether that means UCI podiums, desolate roads, hefty gravel excursions, or a quick post-work shred on your local trails. To say it's the best cyclocross bike we've ever ridden is totally accurate, but of course we're going to say that.\nHand made here in California, you paint it (or we can), and it looks awesome. Make the new Squidcross your own!",
